Drop project screenshots here to activate the thumbnails.

Expected filenames (referenced from src/data/projects.ts):
  lumenfact.png
  netquest.png
  ar-history-explorer.png
  eatsy.png

Recommended: 1200x750 (16:10), WebP or optimised PNG under 200KB.
Until a file exists, the card falls back to the project name on a dark
panel — intentional, so a missing screenshot never renders as a broken image.
